* GnuCap LED Smoke Test 2 - Two LEDs in parallel from 3.3V
V1 1 0 DC 3.3
R1 1 2 470
D1 2 0 MyLED
R2 1 3 470
D2 3 0 MyLED

.model MyLED D is=1e-14

* Run a DC sweep of the source V1 from 0 to 3.3V in 0.1V steps
.dc V1 0 3.3 0.1

* Print node voltages and per-LED diode currents during the sweep
.print dc v(2) v(3) i(D1) i(D2)

.end
